      "message": "refactor(sim): move precalc orchestration and mailbox to camcraft-sim\n\nThe #2192 review (finding 4) asks for the new domain logic in the\nsimulation crate. The begin/step orchestration (stride choice, store\nrestart, the offer of each boundary) is now camcraft_sim::play_precalc\nbehind a Playback seam; FieldPlay implements it with bindings only.\nThe progress slot and the cancel flag are\ncamcraft_sim::play_precalc_mailbox; the worker binds its stop and clock\nas closures. One seek law, Keyframes::restores, replaces the two copies\nin FieldPlay::seek and the worker. No behaviour change.\n\nPinned by crates/sim/tests/play_precalc.rs (4 tests); the app suites\nstock_play, stock_play_precalc, stock_play_partial and\nstock_sim_document pass unchanged.\n\nRefs #2181\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
